%% section: Deep dives
flowchart TB
    A["Leader holds a lock and writes"] --> B["Leader pauses — GC or a partition"]
    B --> C["Session expires, a new leader is elected"]
    C --> D["New leader writes with a higher token"]
    D --> E["Old leader resumes, still believes it holds the lock"]
    E --> F{"Does its write land?"}
    F -->|"Lock only"| G["Yes — two writers, corrupted state"]
    F -->|"Fencing token"| H["Rejected: its token is older than what the resource has seen"]
    H --> I["The resource enforces it, not the lock service"]
